      "writtenOn": "2022-05-09T07:02:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of adding another collection that stores NetworkRequestInfo objects, can we add a flag into NetworkRequestInfo that stores this information? I think that would be more useful if in the future we need to solve related problems. For now a boolean inside NetworkRequestInfo would be enough, I hope?",
