      "writtenOn": "2022-05-09T07:02:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per discussion: the reason we have false here is that if we set it to true we would need to ensure that either a) any QoS callback registered on this network was unregistered when the app loses permission or b) no QoS callbacks are sent for restricted networks unless the app currently has permission to access restricted networks.\n\nCan we add a TODO to explain this?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10673,
        "startChar": 60,
        "endLine": 10673,
        "endChar": 65
      },
      "revId": "80b8ecfbb7bd5aad0c644094a350027ba6b7e610",
