        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-05-09T07:02:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Maybe rename this to something that will cause the reader t otihnk about ConnectivityService? CsDelegate? ConnectivityServiceDelegate? I don\u0027t think we use the word \"delegate\" in our java code, we call it *Callback. So this class could be PermissionCallback or just Callback.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 207,
        "startChar": 21,
        "endLine": 207,
        "endChar": 29
      },
      "revId": "80b8ecfbb7bd5aad0c644094a350027ba6b7e610",
